    나이 계산기
  </h2>
  <div grid="~ cols-1 md:cols-2" gap="4" mt="6">
    <label>
      <span class="cm-label">생년월일</span>
      <input id="age-birth" class="cm-input" type="date" />
    </label>
    <label>
      <span class="cm-label">기준일</span>
      <input id="age-asof" class="cm-input" type="date" />
